      "content": "but i don't really have a fever or anything, and it's not like i'm throwing up or anything crazy. it just feels like a lot of pressure and bloating. are u sure it's not just something i ate? i feel like i'm overreacting and i really just want to sleep this off so i can go to work tomorrow. can't i just take some tylenol or something to see if it goes away by morning?",
